ut if the gradient colors happen to be close you now get the full range without duplicates e.g.:\r\nMaster:\r\n<img width=\"515\" height=\"166\" alt=\"master_color\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/16442241-3a17-4497-8f3f-ff952f5642c4\" />\r\nThis pr:\r\n<img width=\"515\" height=\"166\" alt=\"pr_color\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7beb9f56-146b-4daf-9228-9e647a220b91\" />\r\n3px gradient from (11, 0, 11) to (13, 100, 13). The center pixel is now (12, 50, 12) instead of (11, 50, 11). (I know you can't see sh*t, but take a color picker and try yourself).\r\n\r\nRounding is necessary since color values are floats on disk and won't yield the same value when multiplied by 255.0 and floored:\r\nE.g. 11 is represented as `0.04313725`.\r\n```gdscript\r\nprint(String.num(0.04313725 * 255.0)) # 10.99999875\r\n```","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","description":"","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"closed","title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https